(
    title: "Deadly Duck",
    developer: Some("Ed Hodapp (Sirius Software)"),
    description: Some("A duck paddles its pond, firing bill-bullets straight up at the eight crabs hauling bricks overhead — bricks float where they splash down, boxing you in, and a direct hit sinks you. Dragonflies can\'t be killed: pot-shotting one is worth ten points but provokes an aimed bomb. Clearing the crabs earns a spare duck and advances the level, adding dragonflies and multiplying the brick bounty."),
